 (exclude .104 as chronic).\n\n## OPEN FALSIFIERS (the spine)\n- #2: v8.3 gate-advance LIVE TEST 09-20 16:03Z.\n- #3: RETENTION.log + digest-stream summary -- rides #2.\n- #5: delegate-path abort watch -- armed; 0 bursts.\n- #6: cycle-path abort watch -- LIVE-FIRED c82+c83+c109+c110+c114+\n  c120+c125+c130+c131+c139+c142+c143 (c143: correct, same-tool tax).\n- REGISTRY-CORRUPTION (c139, AMENDED c140): mechanism live; next\n  .104 WRN burst -\u003e /api/streams diff DURING window (cheap).\n- HEAL-WITHOUT-REPLACEMENT: DEAD for long freezes (6/6). STANDS for\n  short freezes (\u003c5min).\n- LIVE-CATCH: ANSWERED c141+c142 for ext3+ext4. REMAINING: who\n  triggers the remake (go2rtc-internal vs consumer reconnect)?\n- WRN-STORM-PRECEDES-FREEZE: 2-for / 1-against, LEAD TIMES DIFFER\n  (75min storm vs 3min burst). Signal real, not a fixed-interval alarm.\n- CENSUS-VS-RECORDINGS DIVERGENCE (NEW c143): census healthy + ats\n  dead = wedged consumer invisible to producer census. Count it.\n- RECEIVER-DELTA-MATCHES-CENSUS: healthy-side validated c142;\n  freeze-side 1 obs (c141).\n- BARE-CONTRA LIVE TEST: PASSED c137.\n- CENSUS ARTIFACT GUARD LIVE TEST: 0 obs yet.\n- JOURNAL-CONTRA LIVE TEST: ARMED-IDLE.\n- EXT4 POST-FIX PREDICTION (c124) AMENDED c140: ext3 404-storm class\n  is go2rtc shared state; go2rtc upgrade / #2505 fix might address.\n- EXT4 CONN-HOLD WATCH: 0/7 as of c124.\n- RSSI-ROTATION WATCH: PASS c127; armed for recurrence.\n- REDACTOR ANCHOR: next live leak -\u003e classify by preceding char.\n- WRN-HEAL (c127/c132/c135): short freezes self-heal; boundary ~5min.\n- SHARED-CAUSE (c126-\u003ec141): .104 DECOUPLED. Multi-cam audio-freeze\n  events tied to go2rtc conn/registry state + fleet-wide camera\n  degradation windows (dial storms), not .104 bursts.\n- TEST-RUN POLLUTION (c130): watch for a third instance.\n\n## WATCHES (standing)\n- GUARD FALSE-POSITIVE RATIO: 10 legit / 3 runaway + c139 CORRECT +\n  c142 CORRECT + c143 CORRECT (same-tool at call 100, batched work).\n- RECEIPT-CLOCK v8.2 live; RETENTION-BRAN...[+5882 chars]
