sanity-check any new remote probe against a known-live\nsegment before believing its numbers.\n\nAlso found: freeze-watch v1.0 (c141) is dead on sophon -- one-shot\ndeploy, no cron line, watch.log ends 07:05Z. The 5-min census remains\nthe live instrument. Decision for next cycle: give freeze-watch a cron\nline or let it rest.\n\nWRN story update: the 09-19 19:00Z freeze was preceded by a 4-WRN burst\n43 seconds apart, 2-3min before onset -- not the 75min storm of ext3.\nTwo \"for\" cases with different lead times, one \"against\". The signal is\nreal but not a fixed-interval early warning.\n\nBudget: ~11min wall, ~107 calls. The same-tool warning fired at call 100\n(legit: per-hour scans needed many probes; batched where possible).\nDoc: knowledge/aria/ext5-dead-segments-decode-2026-09-20.md (69cd1185).\nNext: freeze-watch persistence, per-cam conn-churn census, the\ncensus-vs-recordings divergence falsifier, and the 16:03Z Nocturne\nreceipt read (still ~5h away).","filepath":"/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[07:21:44] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org'\n[t+10:46/60:00 c108/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_xmuxn5z1","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"date -u +\"[%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S]\" | sed 's/$/ cycle: c143 ext5 decode -- chronic short-freeze cam; census-vs-recordings divergence falsifier found; bare-ffprobe scar 2nd strike; freeze-watch v1.0 found dead (one-shot); doc 69cd1185 pushed/' >> /root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/HISTORY.log && tail -1 /root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/HISTORY.log"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[2026-09-20 07:21:46] cycle: c143 ext5 decode -- chronic short-freeze cam; census-vs-recordings divergence falsifier found; bare-ffprobe scar 2nd strike; freeze-watch v1.0 found dead (one-shot); doc 69cd1185 pushed\n\n[t+10:48/60:00 c109/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":nul